# claude-system configuration.
#
# Copy to ~/.claude/.env (NOT committed). Shell syntax: hooks source this
# file, and install.sh bakes the values into the coordinator + dashboard
# systemd units. Every key is OPTIONAL — omit one and the default shown
# applies. Re-run ./install.sh after editing to apply changes to services.

# Where research projects live (each project is a subdirectory).
# PROJECTS_ROOT="$HOME/projects/research"

# Filesystem path sampled for free disk in /headroom and the dashboard.
# Point this at the volume your projects actually live on.
# DISK_MONITOR_PATH="$HOME/projects"

# Dashboard bind address (host:port). 0.0.0.0 exposes it on the LAN;
# use 127.0.0.1:8080 to keep it localhost-only.
# CLAUDE_DASHBOARD_BIND="0.0.0.0:8080"

# Model roles are a per-project setting, not machine config: see each
# project's budget.yaml (models.ideator / models.implementer). The template
# defaults both to "opus" (latest Opus release).

# ntfy topic for notifications (create one at https://ntfy.sh/). Optional.
NTFY_TOPIC=your-topic-here
